    },
    {
      "ordinal": 66,
      "label": "coach_paldea_friend_randomtalk_02",
      "hash64": "9EB3DE09A671C6BF",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)][VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳媽媽\\n做的料理很好吃呢～\\c\\n下次也讓我嚐嚐\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳做的三明治吧。[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
