    {
      "ordinal": 67,
      "label": "coach_paldea_friend_randomtalk_03",
      "hash64": "9EB3DD09A671C50C",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的[VAR 0x0101(0001)]牠\\n常常和獒教父玩成一團！\\r\\n謝謝[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳把這隻好傢伙交換給我啊！[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
